00:34:37.822 --> 00:34:39.780
So we've got a few
questions from the audience.

00:34:39.780 --> 00:34:42.090
The first question
is, what kind of data

00:34:42.090 --> 00:34:43.530
can I store in Google Cloud?

00:34:43.530 --> 00:34:45.000
Can I include
personal information

00:34:45.000 --> 00:34:47.980
like customer names
and email addresses?

00:34:47.980 --> 00:34:49.409
So the answer is yes.

00:34:49.409 --> 00:34:51.352
You can store any type
of data that you want.

00:34:51.352 --> 00:34:53.310
We actually have a few
different data products.

00:34:53.310 --> 00:34:56.010
We have BigQuery, which
is our data warehouse.

00:34:56.010 --> 00:34:59.430
We also have Spanner and Google
Cloud Storage, which can also

00:34:59.430 --> 00:35:01.050
store unstructured data.

00:35:01.050 --> 00:35:05.520
You are able to include personal
information, PII, customer

00:35:05.520 --> 00:35:07.620
names, email addresses.

00:35:07.620 --> 00:35:10.290
We are a secure platform,
but it's up to you

00:35:10.290 --> 00:35:13.300
to decide what you want
to do with your own data.

00:35:13.300 --> 00:35:14.970
The second question
