00:35:14.970 --> 00:35:17.880
integrate with my on premise
systems or other marketing

00:35:17.880 --> 00:35:19.350
systems in other clouds?

00:35:19.350 --> 00:35:22.150
The answer is yes,
Google can integrate.

00:35:22.150 --> 00:35:23.970
So you absolutely can
write your own code

00:35:23.970 --> 00:35:26.250
to integrate with
your on premise

00:35:26.250 --> 00:35:30.210
systems, any other systems
that you have in the Cloud.

00:35:30.210 --> 00:35:33.120
Like I mentioned, we have
our Google Cloud Service,

00:35:33.120 --> 00:35:37.500
which you can use to help
upload data in between.

00:35:37.500 --> 00:35:38.910
And you can also
use partners who

00:35:38.910 --> 00:35:41.730
can help to integrate
data and help that data

00:35:41.730 --> 00:35:43.954
move on prem to the Cloud.

00:35:43.954 --> 00:35:45.120
DAVID LANGTON: Yeah, indeed.

00:35:45.120 --> 00:35:47.040
And in the Matillion
demo you just saw,

00:35:47.040 --> 00:35:49.020
I only very briefly
