00:35:49.020 --> 00:35:50.430
of the folders
full of connectors

00:35:50.430 --> 00:35:53.460
we do for all sorts
of systems, some

00:35:53.460 --> 00:35:56.520
of those running in the Cloud,
some of them on premise.

00:35:56.520 --> 00:35:58.620
We also have a
