00:36:16.435 --> 00:36:17.310
ANDREA RUSSELL: Yeah.

00:36:17.310 --> 00:36:18.165
Flexible solution.

00:36:18.165 --> 00:36:18.750
Awesome.

00:36:18.750 --> 00:36:22.600
So we've got lots of connectors
in, lots of connectors out.

00:36:22.600 --> 00:36:23.430
It's awesome.

00:36:23.430 --> 00:36:26.610
So the next question is I'm
in a specialized industry.

00:36:26.610 --> 00:36:28.530
Can I use Google Cloud?

00:36:28.530 --> 00:36:29.790
Why, yes you can.

00:36:29.790 --> 00:36:32.370
So we actually have tons
of-- well, not tons,

00:36:32.370 --> 00:36:34.710
