00:36:34.710 --> 00:36:40.710
So for example, health care,
IOT Internet of Things, finance.

00:36:40.710 --> 00:36:42.884
We also have
government-specific solutions.

00:36:42.884 --> 00:36:44.550
So if you're interested
in learning more

00:36:44.550 --> 00:36:49.410
